{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o057b","title":"郭修被姜维掳至蜀","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o057b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"郭修被姜维掳至蜀","evidence":["shaodi-e-o057b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0049","role":"被俘","evidence":["shaodi-e-o057b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0050","role":"掳人","evidence":["shaodi-e-o057b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"乃者（被掳）","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["shaodi-e-o057b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o057b-q","source_order":[4,242,"O057b"],"order":1096}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0049","name":"郭修","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0050","name":"姜维","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o057b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-62de37a81864196f8119","layer":"original","quote":"八月，诏曰：“故中郎西平郭修〖2〗，砥节厉行，秉心不回〖3〗。乃者蜀将姜维寇抄修郡〖4〗，为所执略。往岁伪大将军费祎，驱率群众〖5〗，阴图窥窬〖6〗；道经汉寿〖7〗，请会众宾。修于广坐之中，手刃击祎〖8〗，勇过聂政〖9〗，功逾介子〖10〗。可谓杀身成仁，释生取义者矣〖11〗。夫追加褒宠，所以表扬忠义；祚及后胤，所以奖劝将来。其追封修为长乐乡侯，食邑千户，谥曰威侯；子袭爵，加拜奉车都尉〖12〗；赐银千鉼〖13〗，绢千匹。以光宠存亡〖14〗，永垂来世焉。”﹝三﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":231,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
